"use strict";(self.webpackChunkdocs=self.webpackChunkdocs||[]).push([[34539],{49098:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"functions":[],"properties":[],"types":[],"name":"NpcHitFxController","desc":"Hit feedback for `EnemyNPC` models with attribute health (pirate boarders,\\nno Humanoid):\\n\\n- **Glow:** on every `Health` drop a `Highlight` flashes red-white and fades\\n  out (everyone sees it). Skipped while another Highlight (Weak Spot) is on\\n  the body, or when `MAX_FLASHES` bodies already flash (Roblox caps Highlights at 31).\\n- **Health bar:** a clone of `ReplicatedStorage.GuiAssets.NpcHealthBar`\\n  (BillboardGui, parented to PlayerGui, Adornee = Head) shows on the first\\n  drop and hides `EnemyBrainConfig.HealthBarHideAfter` s after the last one.\\n  10 cells like the player HP bar: cell i fill = `clamp(h / max * 10 - (i - 1), 0, 1)`.\\n  `Ghost` is the damage chip: it holds the old health, then eases down.\\n- **Damage numbers:** `Packets.NpcDamaged` (server \u2192 the hitter only) \u2192\\n  `DamageNumbers.Show` above the head. Hits within `MERGE_WINDOW` on one body\\n  add up into one number (a shotgun shot shows one number, not one per pellet).\\n\\nTemplate names are load-bearing: `Frame/Cell1..10/{Ghost, Fill}`.","realm":["Client"],"source":{"line":23,"path":"src/StarterPlayer/StarterPlayerScripts/NpcHitFxController.client.luau"}}')}}]);